nt where that field isn=E2=80=99t null, regardless of the intended credenti=
al check. As a URL-encoded parameter: <code>username[$ne]=3Dinvalid&amp;pas=
sword[$ne]=3Dinvalid</code>. As a JSON body: <code>{"username": {"$ne": nul=
l}, "password": {"$ne": null}}</code>.</p></div><div class=3D"w-embed"></di=
