temprop=3D"text" class=3D"faq-rich-text w-richtext"><p>Cover JSON request b=
ody operator injection (replacing string values with operator objects like =
<code>{"$ne": null}</code>), URL parameter array injection (<code>param[$ne=
]=3Dvalue</code> notation, which PHP and Express.js parse as nested objects=
), header injection where custom headers reach a query, and GraphQL variabl=
e injection where a resolver doesn=E2=80=99t enforce the type its schema de=
clares. Automated API DAST tools test these systematically across every end=
point and encoding variation, which is difficult to match by hand across a =
large API surface.</p></div><div class=3D"w-embed"></div></div></div></div>=
